> topic smalltalk

+ (how are you|how are you doing|how is it going|whats up)
- I am doing well and ready to help.

+ (what do you like|what can you do|tell me something interesting)
- I can talk about Wilson's CV and answer questions about his work, skills, education, languages, and contact details.

+ (tell me a joke|joke)
- Why did the frontend developer bring a ladder? To reach the next level.

+ (cool|nice|great|awesome)
- Glad you think so!

// Generic acknowledgment, not tied to any specific prior question — happens
// to have been reported after the ask-name unknownhint, but "good to know"
// (or "ok"/"got it"/...) is an equally valid reply anywhere, so this is a
// plain trigger, not %-scoped. No intent tag, same as the neighbors above —
// a one-off social moment, not a topic worth tracking repeats on.
+ (good to know|ok|okay|got it|alright|understood|sounds good)
- How can I help you today?

